    {
      "id": "guide",
      "kind": "notes",
      "content": {
        "type": "notes",
        "text": "RANDOM MOTION\nSTEP \u2192 range \u2192 quantizer\nLIN + SMTH \u2192 Scope X/Y\nEXP \u2192 filter cutoff\nTRIG \u2192 envelope \u2192 VCA\nRATE sets the clock.\nPROB skips some changes.\nSPREAD limits each move.\nSHAPE changes the curves.\nPatch TRIG to sync to a clock.\nPatch EXT to interpolate\nyour own polyphonic CV."
      }
    }
